    <string name="off_policy">Updates follow how often things change: the timetable every week, places and routing every month, the map when swisstopo or ASTRA publish a new one (unchanged tiles are only checked, not fetched again). Nothing is downloaded without you; a line on the first screen says when something is worth updating.</string>
